        "TileImage": "$($repository a1f7ac80-7fe3-4df1-b332-539c78a72a87).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Your targets today are a number of undercover agents, sent by Interpol to investigate an organ trafficking operation that is suspected to be taking place in the hospital. Our client, Dr. Katashi Ito, has hired us to keep the operation a secret. It&apos;s an unpalatable contract, but the Board has ordered us to see it through.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
